span><span begin="01:31.647" end="01:31.906">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.906" end="01:33.761"><span begin="01:31.906" end="01:32.065">But </span><span begin="01:32.065" end="01:32.206">you're </span><span begin="01:32.206" end="01:32.583">breaking </span><span begin="01:32.583" end="01:32.805">through </span><span begin="01:32.805" end="01:32.978">all </span><span begin="01:32.978" end="01:33.161">the </span><span begin="01:33.161" end="01:33.409">dark </span><span begin="01:33.409" end="01:33.581">in </span><span begin="01:33.581" end="01:33.761">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.761" end="01:35.269"><span begin="01:33.761" end="01:33.958">When </span><span begin="01:33.958" end="01:34.128">I </span><span begin="01:34.128" end="01:34.368">thought </span><span begin="01:34.368" end="01:34.528">that </span><span begin="01:34.528" end="01:34.816">nobody </span><span begin="01:34.816" end="01:35.269">could</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.363" end="01:37.117"><span begin="01:35.363" end="01:35.550">And </span><span begin="01:35.550" end="01:35.710">you're </span><span begin="01:35.710" end="01:36.023">waking </span><span begin="01:36.023" end="01:36.176">up </span><span begin="01:36.176" end="01:36.360">all </span><span begin="01:36.360" end="01:36.520">these </span><span begin="01:36.520" end="01:36.763">parts </span><span begin="01:36.763" end="01:36.942">of </span><span begin="01:36.942" end="01:37.117">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.117" end="01:38.627"><span begin="01:37.117" end="01:37.301">That </span><span begin="01:37.301" end="01:37.477">I </span><span begin="01:37.477" end="01:37.670">thought </span><span begin="01:37.670" end="01:37.837">were </span><span begin="01:37.837" end="01:38.014">buried </span><span begin="01:38.014" end="01:38.200">for </span><span begin="01:38.200" end="01:38.627">good</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.627" end="01:40.314"><span begin="01:38.627" end="01:38.993">Between </span